This repository contains configuration files, scripts and documentation for
porting LineageOS 24 (Android 17) to the Lenovo Legion Y700 Gen5 (TB323FU,
SM8850P / kaanapali, codename TB323FU).

No Lenovo or Qualcomm proprietary binaries, firmware, kernel images or disk
images are distributed in this repository. Builders must obtain the required
proprietary files from firmware they are legally entitled to use (for example,
a full dump of their own device). See docs/COMPLIANCE.md and
proprietary-files.txt.

Third-party components and references retain their original notices. See
CREDITS.md and docs/ATTRIBUTION.md.

